From dad25c45ab245bd05e04f0e1d73203fb1b42c48b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mcsm <mcsm@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:18:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] impeller (mcsm8): a Vulkan render pass's cached render
 pass and framebuffer are keyed on the whole attachment set (every
 attachment's texture by a never-reused id, load and store actions,
 subresource, a loaded attachment's layout), not only colour 0's subresource:
 a Flutter GPU pass loading a target first cleared by another pass cleared it
 again, and one with another depth target drew into the first one's; loaded
 attachments start in their tracked layout (depth/stencil started undefined,
 colour attachments past the first were never tracked: both now end in the
 render pass's finalLayout), and a loaded attachment never written is moved to
 an attachment layout first (a load from UNDEFINED is invalid)

